{"ID":"20230927095353-odkch2d","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927095353-odkch2d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095353-odkch2d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095402-nz6u9ll\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095402-hyjfoj8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095402-hyjfoj8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:36,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:36\u0026#125;","title":"【附子细辛黄连黄芩汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927095402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927095402-nz6u9ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927095402-nz6u9ll","updated":"20230927095402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：附子大者一枚(炮去皮，破八片) 、细辛二两、黄连四两、黄芩二两"}]},{"ID":"20230927095402-xcsqolr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927095402-xcsqolr","updated":"20230927095402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，以水六升，煮取三升，温服一升，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230927095402-hyjfoj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927095402-hyjfoj8","updated":"20230927095402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传少阴，脉沉细而数，手足时厥时热，咽中痛，小便难，宜附子细辛黄连黄苓汤。"}]}]}